    "title": "Letter to the Editor: Outgoing Newburgh Supervisor endorses Manley as successor - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mid-Hudson News Staff ,\n17 hours ago As my term as Supervisor ends, I strongly recommend my Deputy Supervisor, Scott Manley, as my successor. During my time working with Scott as my deputy, I have had the opportunity to observe his leadership and understanding of the office’s responsibilities. I am confident that electing my deputy, Scott Manley, as supervisor would ensure continuity in leadership, maintain stability, and support a smooth transition. There is no substitute for experience. Read full article",
